OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start this morning with
OL,6,Fearly mist and fog patches quickly
OL,7,Fclearing. Otherwise, a dry and fine
OL,8,Fday today with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine with
OL,10,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry and fine overnight with
OL,13,Flong clear spells. A few mist and fog
OL,14,Fpatches may form, with rural
OL,15,Ftemperatures dipping into single
OL,16,Ffigures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
