OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,7,FNortheastern coasts may see cloud
OL,8,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,9,FSea, with the odd spot of rain
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FTurning unsettled midweek, with spells
OL,14,Fof rain and showers. Some heavy rain
OL,15,Fand thunderstorms are possible at
OL,16,Ftimes but also some drier and sunnier
OL,17,Fspells. Warmer and more humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
